Syntax: psycrush <victim>

Psychic crush is the most devastating of the direct psionic attacks,
overwhelming an enemy's mind with crushing mental force. The power
attempts to completely dominate the victim's psyche, potentially
triggering primal fear and sensory shutdown.

A successful crush deals substantial damage and may inflict blindness
as the victim's mind struggles to process the overwhelming assault.
This blindness is temporary but can leave an opponent helpless at a
critical moment. Strong-willed or magically protected targets may
resist this effect.

Beyond the damage and potential blindness, the crush can trigger an
overwhelming sense of terror in its victims. Those who fail to resist
may flee in panic, abandoning combat entirely. Again, powerful foes
may be immune to this fear effect.

The power initiates combat if the psionicist is not already engaged with
the target. If used in combat, it can be directed at the current opponent
without specifying a target.

Psychic crush requires advanced skill to develop and consumes significant
mana. It represents the pinnacle of direct psionic assault techniques.
The power cannot be used while focusing your mind.

See Also: PSIONICS, PSIONIC BLAST, MIND THRUST, MIND FOCUS, FEAR

